			"open": false,
			"file": "hoa_fl2018.jpg",
			"shows": "The park of Bãi Trước in the morning: a flower bed of low plants with narrow grey green leaves and many purple flowers of five lobes on their tops, a low clipped border of small green leaves in front of it, lawns, frangipani trees, rock sculptures. The file is a crop of the bed at the full size of the photo (4188 px)."
		},
		{
			"url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cong_vien_bai_truoc-Ph%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Dng_1,_tp._V%C5%A9ng_T%C3%A0u,_B%C3%A0_R%E1%BB%8Ba_-_V%C5%A9ng_T%C3%A0u,_Vi%E1%BB%87t_Nam_-_panoramio_(1).jpg",
