			"author": "trungydang",
			"open": true,
			"file": "park_flower_bed_2014.jpg",
			"shows": "The park in the morning: a round flower bed with a ring of red leaves and low yellow green plants in it, a low square white lamp (0.70 m) beside it."
		}
	],
