			"seen": "An olive green mass 0.42 m wide and 0.26 m high with violet spots of about 5 cm on its top and its upper sides: the colors and the size of the bed of photo 0. The bumps of the top are smooth at the mid level (cells of 2.5 cm, 400 triangles), so the outline is a soft dome; in a bed the clumps touch, and only their tops show. At the mid distance (15 m to 40 m) a clump is 10 px to 25 px.",
